/T (So far, deliverables since the adoption of the 2007 JAES have been scarce except in the area of peace and security. In spite of the validity of its objective to work towards an equal partnership, it has been hindered by its overambition and differences in capacities and priorities \(Miyandazi et al., 2020\). )
/E (So far, deliverables since the adoption of the 2007 JAES have been scarce except in the area of peace and security. In spite of the validity of its objective to work towards an equal partnership, it has been hindered by its overambition and differences in capacities and priorities \(Miyandazi et al., 2020\). )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [7]
>>
