/T ([5] A caveat is important: Whereas the information presented here is grouped in geographical regions, WVS data is a representation of national levels, which means this data is not representative of the population on each continent. Even though WVS applies its own sampling weights to ensure national representativeness, enabling comparison of regions or continents, the national-level data is more precise.)
/E ([5] A caveat is important: Whereas the information presented here is grouped in geographical regions, WVS data is a representation of national levels, which means this data is not representative of the population on each continent. Even though WVS applies its own sampling weights to ensure national representativeness, enabling comparison of regions or continents, the national-level data is more precise.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
