/T (Malte Brosig is Professor in International Relations at the Department of International Relations at the University of the Witwatersrand in Johannesburg. He joined the Department in 2009 after he received his PhD from the University of Portsmouth. His main research interests focus on issues of international organizations and security in Africa and Europe. malte.brosig@wits.ac.za )
